n\nNew\n- Open videos and images from any folder on your headset: choose \"Open file from this device\u2026\" in the Media list. Large videos start right away without being copied.\n- NDI sources now appear automatically, the list updates every few seconds.\n\nImproved\n- Updated to Unity 6 and the latest OpenXR and hand tracking support.\n- Teleport works with controllers and with hand tracking.\n- The menu opens with the menu button on the left controller.\n- The Media list only shows formats the headset can play (mp4, mov, jpg, png).\n\nFixed\n- Loading jpg and png images.\n- Artifacts on the seat texture.\n- A file that fails to load no longer leaves old content on the dome.\n\nTip: If no NDI sources show up, make sure the headset and the sending computer are on the same network and the sender's firewall allows NDI.", "created_date": 1795008497, "id": "29844241201850178", "version": "1.5", "version_code": 25, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "4747161018651543", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "29844241201850178"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": []}, "change_log": null, "created_date": 1743722337, "id": "9961289953905264", "version": "1.4", "version_code": 24, "release_status": "PENDING", "status": "DRAFT", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "4747161018651543", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename":